OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'disappointed' by triple
OL,4,Amurder court delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman and two girls
OL,7,Ffound dead at their home have said they
OL,8,Fare "disappointed" after court
OL,9,Fproceedings were delayed.
OL,11,FNothabo Zandile Tshuma, 42, and her
OL,12,Fdaughters Natalie, 15, and Nala, five,
OL,13,Fwere found dead in Great Denham, near
OL,14,FBedford, on 6 July.
OL,16,FHer husband, Ndodana Mkhanyisi Tshuma,
OL,17,F45, is in custody in Johannesburg,
OL,18,FSouth Africa after he was arrested on
OL,19,Fseparate firearms charges. UK
OL,20,Fauthorities have authorised three
OL,21,Fmurder charges against him.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
